WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:04.030
Rat stuck out a brown paw.

2
00:00:04.031 --> 00:00:06.812
He grabbed Toad by the neck.

3
00:00:06.813 --> 00:00:10.369
"Here you go, Toad!" said Rat.

4
00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:14.426
Rat pulled Toad into his hole.

5
00:00:14.427 --> 00:00:17.784
"Oh Ratty!" cried Toad.

6
00:00:17.785 --> 00:00:20.717
"My life has been awful!

7
00:00:20.718 --> 00:00:23.235
Everyone was chasing me!

8
00:00:23.236 --> 00:00:28.727
I've suffered so much!"

9
00:00:28.728 --> 00:00:32.429
"Well, you're safe now," said Rat.

10
00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:35.415
Rat patted Toad's head.

11
00:00:35.416 --> 00:00:40.391
Then Toad smiled proudly.

12
00:00:40.392 --> 00:00:44.256
"I escaped from jail!" he shouted.

13
00:00:44.257 --> 00:00:46.910
"And I stole a horse!

14
00:00:46.911 --> 00:00:50.667
Oh, I am a clever Toad!

15
00:00:50.668 --> 00:00:54.001
I'll tell you all about it!"

16
00:00:54.002 --> 00:00:57.609
"Wait," said Rat, holding up a paw.

17
00:00:57.610 --> 00:01:00.792
"First, go change your clothes."

18
00:01:00.793 --> 00:01:04.816
"What?" asked Toad, confused.

19
00:01:04.817 --> 00:01:09.054
"You look like a washwoman," said Rat.

20
00:01:09.055 --> 00:01:13.142
Toad held up a corner of his dress.

21
00:01:13.143 --> 00:01:16.894
"Oh this," he said shyly.

22
00:01:16.895 --> 00:01:21.054
"It's a long story. I—"

23
00:01:21.055 --> 00:01:25.559
"Stop talking and clean yourself up!" said Rat.

24
00:01:25.560 --> 00:01:28.248
"You look a mess!"

25
00:01:28.249 --> 00:01:32.851
"Now, Rat," said Toad, getting angry.

26
00:01:32.852 --> 00:01:36.741
Then he saw himself in the mirror.

27
00:01:36.742 --> 00:01:39.563
"Oh my," said Toad.

28
00:01:39.564 --> 00:01:42.084
"I do look awful."

29
00:01:42.085 --> 00:01:46.862
He ran to the bedroom to wash up.

30
00:01:46.863 --> 00:01:51.038
Toad put on some of Rat's best clothes.

31
00:01:51.039 --> 00:01:53.686
He looked in the mirror again.

32
00:01:53.687 --> 00:01:57.521
"I'm so handsome!" he said.

33
00:01:57.522 --> 00:02:02.952
"Who could think I was a washwoman?"

